title Cadence drops instantly from 90 to 30 rpm without stopping (level 3)

# Close to stopping: the next PAS pulse is three times as late, so predictive
# stop fires. Pedalling resumes within the stop delay, so assist picks up
# where it was instead of ramping up from zero (that would take ~400ms).
at 1000 cadence 90 over 500
at 4000 cadence 30
at 7000 cadence 0

end 8000

expect 3990 current == 12
expect 4110 current >= 12
expect 4300 current == 14
